  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Wrap a ssam-wrap in a paper towel and microwave for 20-30 seconds to warm it.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Add the mixed herbs to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Place an anchovy fillet on each warmed ssam-wrap, followed by a spoonful of mixed greens and a sprinkle of walnuts.",
    "Drizzle the lemon herb sauce over the top of each wrap.",
    "Place a slice of crispy bacon on top of each wrap.",
    "Sprinkle grated cheddar cheese over the bacon.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
